  "short_description": "<p>Natural handwoven seagrass storage basket – durable, eco-friendly, and multipurpose. Made in Vietnam for wholesale and export.</p>",
  "description": "<p data-start=\"344\" data-end=\"627\">This <strong data-start=\"349\" data-end=\"394\">handwoven storage basket made of seagrass</strong> is crafted by skilled artisans in Vietnam using 100% natural and sustainable seagrass. Lightweight yet strong, the basket is ideal for organizing clothes, towels, toys, magazines, and more, while adding a natural touch to any space.</p>\n<p data-start=\"629\" data-end=\"850\">Each basket features tight weaving and a smooth finish, available in natural tones or dyed colors. With optional handles and lids, these baskets are suitable for home décor, retail displays, hotel use, and gift packaging.</p>\n<p data-start=\"852\" data-end=\"1048\">At <strong data-start=\"855\" data-end=\"886\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd</strong>, we are a trusted <strong data-start=\"905\" data-end=\"944\">manufacturer and wholesale supplier</strong>, offering OEM/ODM customization, eco-friendly packaging, and large-volume exports to clients worldwide.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1050\" data-end=\"1053\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1055\" data-end=\"1077\">✅ <strong data-start=\"1060\" data-end=\"1077\">Key Features:</strong></h2>\n<ul data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1384\">\n<li data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1122\">\n<p data-start=\"1080\" data-end=\"1122\">Handwoven from 100% sustainable seagrass</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1123\" data-end=\"1166\">\n<p data-start=\"1125\" data-end=\"1166\">Durable, biodegradable, and lightweight</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1167\" data-end=\"1224\">\n<p data-start=\"1169\" data-end=\"1224\">Multipurpose: home storage, retail, hotel, or gifting</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1225\" data-end=\"1276\">\n<p data-start=\"1227\" data-end=\"1276\">Available in multiple sizes, shapes, and colors</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1331\">\n<p data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1331\">Customizable handles, lining, labels, and branding</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1332\" data-end=\"1384\">\n<p data-start=\"1334\" data-end=\"1384\">Ethically made in rural Vietnam by skilled weavers</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<hr data-start=\"1386\" data-end=\"1389\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1391\" data-end=\"1418\">🌿 <strong data-start=\"1397\" data-end=\"1416\">Why It Matters:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1419\" data-end=\"1445\">This storage basket helps:</p>\n<ul data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1758\">\n<li data-start=\"1446\" data-end=\"1498\">\n<p data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1498\"><strong data-start=\"1448\" data-end=\"1484\">Generate foreign exchange income</strong> for Vietnam</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1499\" data-end=\"1580\">\n<p data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1580\"><strong data-start=\"1501\" data-end=\"1539\">Support rural artisans and farmers</strong>, especially during non-harvest seasons</p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1581\" data-end=\"1634\">\n<p data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1634\"><strong data-start=\"1583\" data-end=\"1632\">Utilize 100% domestic raw materials and labor</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1635\" data-end=\"1690\">\n<p data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1690\"><strong data-start=\"1637\" data-end=\"1688\">Preserve traditional Vietnamese weaving culture</strong></p>\n</li>\n<li data-start=\"1691\" data-end=\"1758\">\n<p data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1758\"><strong data-start=\"1693\" data-end=\"1715\">Promote eco-living</strong> by reducing reliance on plastic products</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<p data-start=\"1760\" data-end=\"1891\">Vietnam Handicraft Co., Ltd is proud to be your <strong data-start=\"1808\" data-end=\"1857\">factory, manufacturer, and wholesale exporter</strong> for sustainable seagrass baskets.</p>\n<hr data-start=\"1893\" data-end=\"1896\" />\n<h2 data-start=\"1898\" data-end=\"1932\">✉️ <strong data-start=\"1904\" data-end=\"1930\">Contact for Wholesale:</strong></h2>\n<p data-start=\"1933\" data-end=\"2024\">📧 Email: <a class=\"cursor-pointer\" rel=\"noopener\" data-start=\"1943\" data-end=\"1966\">vietcraft2006@gmail.com</a><br data-start=\"1966\" data